<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Settings | Gregory Park Nuwara Eliya"
  description="Which cookies this independent guide and its embedded services may set, why there is no on-site switch, and how to control them in your browser."
  heading="Cookie Settings"
  updated="5 November 2026"
  canonicalPath="/cookie-settings"
  introSi="පිටු බැලීම්, උපාංග/බ්‍රවුසර තොරතුරු සහ භාවිත දත්ත Google වෙත යැවිය හැකි අතර කුකීස් භාවිතා කළ හැක. මෙහි කැමැත්ත පාලකයක් හෝ විශ්ලේෂණය නවත්වන ස්විචයක් නැත."
  introEn="This guide does not offer an on-site cookie switch. Google Analytics loads automatically when any page opens. This page lists the categories and the browser-level controls available to you; it does not save preferences, because there is no preference control on this site."
>
  <section>
    <h2>1. What this page can and cannot do</h2>
    <p class="legal-callout">There is no “save settings” button here because no such control exists on this site. Closing this page does not change what loads. Analytics is enabled by default on every page, including legal pages.</p>
    <p>Unlike a consent manager, this guide cannot disable Google Analytics for you or remember a choice. The controls below are actions you take in your own browser or with your own tools.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. Cookie categories</h2>
    <div class="legal-cards">
      <article class="legal-card">
        <h3>Strictly necessary</h3>
        <p>The site itself sets no login, shopping or preference cookies. Cloudflare may set cookies needed to deliver pages and provide security. These cannot be switched off from this guide.</p>
        <span class="legal-tag">Cannot be disabled here</span>
      </article>
      <article class="legal-card">
        <h3>Analytics</h3>
        <p>Google Analytics 4 (G-HXM22WWPKP) loads on every page and may use cookies to measure page views and usage. A Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon may also be present depending on hosting settings.</p>
        <span class="legal-tag">Always on here · no site switch</span>
      </article>
      <article class="legal-card">
        <h3>Embedded map</h3>
        <p>The map section embeds a Google Maps frame. Google may set cookies when that frame loads. Blocking third-party cookies or frames may stop the map displaying; the guide text stays readable.</p>
        <span class="legal-tag">Third-party · Google</span>
      </article>
      <article class="legal-card">
        <h3>Advertising</h3>
        <p>This guide runs no advertising or retargeting campaigns and sets no marketing cookies of its own. Third-party providers apply their own policies to data they process.</p>
        <span class="legal-tag">Not used by this guide</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or browse in a private window.</li>
      <li>Use a content-blocking extension or Google's official Analytics opt-out add-on to stop analytics scripts from loading.</li>
      <li>Review <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's privacy policy</a> and your Google account controls for data held by Google.</li>
      <li>Disable third-party cookies or embedded frames to avoid the map; the external Google Maps link in the <a href="/#map">map section</a> remains available.</li>
      <li>If these options are not acceptable to you, please stop using this site.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Local storage and changes</h2>
    <p>The registered service worker only removes this guide's legacy caches. It does not store personal data, does not intercept requests and does not provide an offline forecast. This guide does not use a consent cookie or a preference store.</p>
    <p>We may update this page when the site's services change; the date at the top shows the latest revision. See the <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a> for data handling and the <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of service</a> for conditions of use.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
